      <h2 id="network-observability-flows-format_json_reference" class="group scroll-mt-20">Network Flows format reference<a href="#network-observability-flows-format_json_reference" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
